          "filename": "Karla Caves Great Chaitya Left pillar No9.jpg",
          "caption": "Karla Caves Great Chaitya Left pillar No9. This pillar was donated by a Yavana circa 120 CE, like five other pillars. The inscription of this pillar reads: \"dhenukākaṭa yavanasa | yasavadhanānaṃ | thabo danaṃ\" i.e. \"(This) pillar (is) the gift of the Yavana Yasavadhana from Denukakata\".[1] Below: detail of the word \"Yavanasa\" (, adjectival form of \"Yavana\", old Brahmi script).",
